<h2>You are invited</h2>

<p>Hello <%= @name %>,</p>

<p>
  You have been invited to use the
  <strong>Sample Request Automation</strong> system.
</p>

<p>
  Please click the button below to accept your invitation.
</p>

<p>
  <a
    href="<%= @invitation_link %>"
    style="
      display:inline-block;
      padding:10px 18px;
      background:#2563eb;
      color:white;
      text-decoration:none;
      border-radius:5px;
    "
  >
    Accept Invitation
  </a>
</p>

<p>
  After accepting the invitation, you will be asked to
  create your password.
</p>

<p>
  If you did not expect this invitation, you can ignore this email.
</p>